{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56922","headline":"天复初刘道昌得篆书 · 佚名","name":"天复初刘道昌得篆书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"八雄争天下，狫鼠先啾唧。\n（自庚子年黄巢见，朱全忠等八人僭号）。\n兔子上天牀，（马建属兔，又以卯年开国）猿猴三下失。\n（朱温三帝属猴也）李子生狼藉，（昭宗也）乃牛生叛䍽。\n（杨行密王於吴。\n斗牛，吴之分也）羣犬嘶首尾，走上中华国。\n（即六侵中国也。\n见《分门古今类事》卷十四引《宾仙传》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56922.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56922","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}